    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Alumnus Ahmed Noor, MBBS '97, is a shining example of what perseverance looks like. Currently working as a consultant cardiologist at a leading tertiary care hospital in Karachi, Ahmed's journey began in his hometown of Quetta, Balochistan, where he had to overcome a number of constraints to achieve his dream of becoming a doctor.",
